{"id":"793a51498e105ea4","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-forcing4-name-valuation.md","title":"ZFC Forcing4 Name Valuation","display":"df-zfc-forcing4-name-valuation — ZFC Forcing4 Name Valuation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing4-name-valuation","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing4-name-valuation"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing4-name-valuation — ZFC Forcing4 Name Valuation","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch07/58-df-name.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-filter.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing4-name-valuation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing4-name-valuation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing4-name-valuation — ZFC Forcing4 Name Valuation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-name.md\">../batch07/58-df-name.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-filter.md\">../batch15/58-df-filter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,P,\\leq_P,\\dot x,x,\\alpha,F,Y\\in V\">\\(G,P,\\leq_P,\\dot x,x,\\alpha,F,Y\\in V\\)</span> (filter, forcing, name, value, ordinal stage, valuation graph, and a set codomain)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4NameValuation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4NameValuation}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Name}\">\\(\\mathrm{Name}\\)</span> (forcing-name predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-name.md\">../batch07/58-df-name.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\)</span> (filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-filter.md\">../batch15/58-df-filter.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V^P_\\alpha\">\\(V^P_\\alpha\\)</span>（forcing-name hierarchy, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-name.md\">../batch07/58-df-name.md</a>）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing4\\text{-}name\\text{-}valuation} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4NameValuation}_S(G,P,\\leq_P,\\dot x,x)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot x,P)\\land\n\\exists\\alpha,F,Y\\in V\\;\\left[\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\dot x\\in V^P_\\alpha\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(F,V^P_\\alpha,Y)\\land\n\\forall\\dot y\\in V^P_\\alpha\\;\\left(F(\\dot y)=\\{F(\\dot z)\\mid\\exists p\\in G\\;(\\langle\\dot z,p\\rangle\\in\\dot y)\\}\\right)\\land x=F(\\dot x)\\right]\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing4\\text{-}name\\text{-}valuation} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4NameValuation}_S(G,P,\\leq_P,\\dot x,x)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot x,P)\\land\n\\exists\\alpha,F,Y\\in V\\;\\left[\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\dot x\\in V^P_\\alpha\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(F,V^P_\\alpha,Y)\\land\n\\forall\\dot y\\in V^P_\\alpha\\;\\left(F(\\dot y)=\\{F(\\dot z)\\mid\\exists p\\in G\\;(\\langle\\dot z,p\\rangle\\in\\dot y)\\}\\right)\\land x=F(\\dot x)\\right]\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> is a set-function witness for the unique rank-recursive valuation on an ordinal name stage containing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot x\">\\(\\dot x\\)</span>; this binds and types the recursive operator instead of referring to an undefined <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{val}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{val}_G\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · d